sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User (React UI)
  participant API as FastAPI + AI harness
  participant G as Gemini (LLM)
  participant M as MCP server
  participant Y as Yahoo Finance
  participant S as Python sandbox
  U->>API: POST /api/chat "Project $10k in MSFT"
  API->>API: build context (system prompt + last 10 msgs)
  API->>G: message + tool schemas
  G-->>API: call get_technical_indicators(MSFT)
  API->>API: permission check (read)
  API->>M: MCP call_tool
  M->>Y: price history
  Y-->>M: candles
  M-->>API: indicators + sources
  API->>G: tool result
  G-->>API: call run_projection(MSFT, 10000, 3)
  API->>API: permission check (compute)
  API->>S: monte_carlo script (isolated, no internet)
  S-->>API: p10 / p50 / p90 paths
  API->>G: tool result
  G-->>API: final answer + ASSUMPTIONS
  API-->>U: text + table + chart + sources + assumptions
